# Optimum

Optimum is an AI-powered mobile application that delivers a professional sports training experience through real-time movement analysis, performance scoring, and intelligent feedback.

It combines a Swift-based mobile application with an advanced AI system to provide accurate, data-driven coaching without the need for a personal trainer.

---

## Problem

Many individuals struggle with training effectively due to:

- Lack of proper guidance during exercises  
- High cost of personal trainers  
- Risk of injury caused by incorrect form  
- No accurate way to measure performance and progress  

---

## Solution

Optimum addresses these challenges by using artificial intelligence and computer vision to analyze human movements, evaluate performance, and provide real-time feedback.

The system transforms any mobile device into an intelligent personal coach.

---

## Core Capabilities

- Real-time motion and posture analysis  
- Per-movement performance scoring (0–10)  
- Instant feedback and error detection  
- Identification of strengths and weaknesses  
- Continuous progress tracking  

---

## How It Works

The user performs exercises while the mobile application captures movement through the device camera. The AI system processes the video in real time, extracts body landmarks, and analyzes motion patterns.

Each movement is compared against biomechanical models to evaluate correctness. The system then generates a performance score and provides actionable feedback to improve technique.

---

## AI Sports Movement Analysis

The core intelligence of Optimum is powered by an AI Sports Movement Analysis system designed for professional-grade evaluation of athletic performance.

### Key AI Features

- Pose estimation using MediaPipe (33 body landmarks)  
- Object detection and tracking using YOLO (sports equipment recognition)  
- Automatic sport recognition based on movement patterns  
- Biomechanics-based evaluation independent of user experience level  

### Performance Evaluation

- Movement scoring from 0 to 10  
- Detection of posture and alignment errors  
- Identification of strengths and mastered skills  
- Personalized improvement recommendations  

### Real-Time Processing

- Live skeletal tracking visualization  
- Object interaction tracking  
- Continuous progress updates  
- Support for both live camera and uploaded videos  

### Reporting

- Detailed performance analysis reports  
- Export formats: PDF, CSV, JSON  
- Video output with overlays  
- Consistent results between live and processed analysis  

---

## System Architecture

Optimum is built on a modular and scalable architecture designed to support real-time sports movement analysis with high performance and flexibility.

The system is structured into the following components:

### AI Analysis Layer
Responsible for extracting and analyzing human body movements using computer vision and machine learning models. It evaluates posture, detects objects, and measures biomechanical accuracy.

### Video Processing Pipeline
Handles both live camera input and uploaded videos. It processes video frames in real time and prepares data for AI analysis with optimized performance.

### Biomechanical Analysis Engine
Applies sports science principles to evaluate movement quality. It detects errors, assesses technique, and calculates performance scores.

### API Layer (REST)
Connects the mobile application with the AI backend. It manages video uploads, live sessions, progress tracking, and report retrieval.

### Reporting System
Generates structured performance reports including scores, errors, strengths, and improvement suggestions. Reports can be exported in multiple formats for further analysis.

---

## Technology Stack

- Mobile Application: Swift (iOS)  
- Artificial Intelligence: Machine Learning models for motion analysis  
- Computer Vision: MediaPipe, YOLO  
- Backend: Python-based AI processing system  
- Data Output: PDF, CSV, JSON reports  

---

## Use Cases

Optimum can be used for home workouts, beginner training, athlete performance improvement, and injury prevention. It is designed to support users across different fitness levels and sports.

---

## Vision

Optimum aims to make professional-level sports training accessible, scalable, and data-driven by transforming mobile devices into intelligent personal coaches.

---

## Project Context

This project was developed as part of SportHack2030, focusing on innovation in the sports and fitness industry.
